Yes, but you also get a positive alignment bonus every time you kill a non-
aligned monster. Generally speaking, after the early game, alignment is 
nothing to worry about. I generally roleplay a bit, so I won't purposely do 
things that I know will get a "you caitiff" or "you feel guilty" message, 
but if it happens a few times in a game, I don't worry about it.

I actually think knights are pretty cool. They end up being rather decent 
spellcasters in the end. My second ascension was a knight. 

